  "name": "Bread Machine Pumpernickel Bread",
  "subtitle": "A dark, hearty loaf with rye, cocoa, molasses, and caraway.",
  "description": "Combine the ingredients in a bread machine and bake until the loaf is risen, browned, and fully cooked.",
